  itemDictionary:
    _serializedList:
    - Key: Iron Armor
      Value:
        EN_Description: "Without a squire, putting on this colossus is a battle of
          its own. Your legs will tire quickly, and any hope of agility will vanish.\nBut
          when your strength fails, this walking fortress will hold strong. Legend
          says it once saved Sir Galaz from tumbling off a cliff\u2014too heavy to
          fall, too stubborn to die.\n"
        PT_Description: "Sem um escudeiro, vestir este colosso \xE9 uma batalha \xE0
          parte. O cansa\xE7o nas pernas vem r\xE1pido, a agilidade vai embora\u2026\nMas
          quando a for\xE7a te faltar, esta muralha te proteger\xE1. Dizem que salvou
          Sir Galaz de cair de um penhasco \u2014 de t\xE3o im\xF3vel que o deixou.\n"
        Items:
        - Iron Armor
        - Iron Helmet
        - Iron Gauntlets
        - Iron Legwear
